---
/** One snap, as a flow: drag, hold the key, then either release the mouse or cancel. */
---

<figure class="flow">
  <ol>
    <li class="step"><span class="n">1</span><span>Drag a window by its title bar</span></li>
    <li class="edge"><span>hold <kbd>Shift</kbd></span></li>
    <li class="step"><span class="n">2</span><span>Zones appear; the one under the cursor lights up</span></li>
    <li class="edge"><span>then either</span></li>
    <li class="split">
      <ul>
        <li class="ok">
          <span class="edge"><span>release the mouse over a zone</span></span>
          <span class="step end"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span><span>The window snaps to the zone</span></span>
        </li>
        <li class="no">
          <span class="edge"><span>release <kbd>Shift</kbd>, or press <kbd>Esc</kbd></span></span>
          <span class="step end"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true">&times;</span><span>Zones hide, nothing moves</span></span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>Releasing the mouse while no zone is lit also leaves the window where it is.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .flow {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
  }
  .flow ol,
  .flow ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .n,
  .tick {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .n {
    background: var(--accent-tint-strong);
    color: var(--color-accent-text);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
  }
  .tick {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ok .tick {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-on-accent);
  }
  .no .tick {
    background: var(--color-surface-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .edge {
    display: flex;
    padding-left: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  .edge > span::before {
    content: '\2193\00a0\00a0';
  }

  .split ul {
    gap: var(--space-s);
  }
  .split li {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    align-content: start;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }

  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .split ul {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
